2026-09-23 00:34:40,894 | INFO | [sec-insider] [agents] name=bull mode=backtesting model=gemini-3.5-flash-lite cache_hit=False tokens_in=74164 tokens_out=162 tokens_cached_in=56480 tokens_uncached_in=17684 tokens_thinking=0 tokens_total=74326 latency_ms=4346 first_event_latency_ms=1182 tool_calls=3 observability_warnings=0 summary='RESULT: I reviewed the SEC Form 4 RSS feed as of the simulated date 2026-01-06 and verified via point-in-time checks that all retrieved filings postdate the simulation wall (appearing in September 2026). In accordance with the backtesting look-ahead safety rules, no open-market insider purchases are available prior to the simulated datetime. Therefore, no orders were submitted.' trace=/Users/robertgrzesik/Library/Caches/lumibot/1.0/agent_runtime/traces/bull/ae8a6d0655e28b9f6f1807e23ffa08f79d70dd14ca7c13d82ca54568964ac7a6-20260923043440875788.json
