2026-09-23 00:34:57,257 | INFO | [sec-insider] [agents] name=bull mode=backtesting model=gemini-3.5-flash-lite cache_hit=False tokens_in=74706 tokens_out=160 tokens_cached_in=56486 tokens_uncached_in=18220 tokens_thinking=0 tokens_total=74866 latency_ms=4189 first_event_latency_ms=814 tool_calls=3 observability_warnings=0 summary='RESULT: I evaluated the SEC Form 4 feed as of the simulated date 2026-01-07 and confirmed via point-in-time checks that all retrieved filings postdate the simulation wall (appearing in September 2026). Consequently, with zero valid open-market insider purchases available prior to the simulation wall, no bull case can be established from valid filings and no orders were placed.' trace=/Users/robertgrzesik/Library/Caches/lumibot/1.0/agent_runtime/traces/bull/27344a0ce236c764b96dffb9a8d45ff0f0b7270aac97dfc9e72a65d0683d6bd0-20260923043457238271.json
